                        "form": "расторже́ниях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "50cbd576-fa2b-358d-aeb4-bdfa1f64684f",
                        "entry_id": "340bf29b-329f-3946-ae4f-4a0c3fcd8fc5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "действие по значению гл. расторгать, расторгаться"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c9cd1f7b-50b0-44ab-9d0b-4f1e31b20e05",
                                "sense_id": "50cbd576-fa2b-358d-aeb4-bdfa1f64684f",
                                "text": "Правда, я могу работать; но если б я был даже богатый человек, в состоянии ли вы перенести насильственное расторжение с вашим семейством, гнев вашей матери?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1cea5649-9cb0-4e97-bced-4ae48d74d110",
                                "sense_id": "50cbd576-fa2b-358d-aeb4-bdfa1f64684f",
                                "text": "Человеческая смерть есть расторжение тела, возвращаемого земле, и духа, временно ведущего жизнь без тела и проходящего в ней неведомую стезю опыта."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ded228e-ee25-4b5a-bd6c-09a051672fcc",
                                "sense_id": "50cbd576-fa2b-358d-aeb4-bdfa1f64684f",
                                "text": "Беда наша в расторжении жизни теоретической и практической…"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bfecd200-7017-3025-a068-fafd4da01357",
                        "entry_id": "340bf29b-329f-3946-ae4f-4a0c3fcd8fc5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "результат такого действия; прекращение действия чего-либо (договора, соглашения и т. п.)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "76c6aff3-d412-4a83-bb75-1a4b1bce561e",
                                "sense_id": "bfecd200-7017-3025-a068-fafd4da01357",
                                "text": "Это был новый удар для моего дедушки, лишивший его всякой надежды к расторжению ненавистного ему брака и несказанно усиливший его гнев на Арину Васильевну и дочерей."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cdcf31ff-f15b-4c12-9906-ac366bd38d1b",
                        "source_entry_id": "340bf29b-329f-3946-ae4f-4a0c3fcd8fc5",
                        "target_lang_word": "dissolution",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dissolution",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f44d5afc-86de-3168-a72a-908ab643d66b",
                                        "entry_id": "9e807490-a411-3cff-9d57-66a902aeea78",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The termination of an organized body or legislative assembly, especially a formal dismissal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3bbc1f6b-4df6-3f11-a387-f1ecbd181bd4",
                                        "entry_id": "9e807490-a411-3cff-9d57-66a902aeea78",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Disintegration, or decomposition into fragments."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc382a0a-b902-4be1-871a-9e64b254020c",
                                                "sense_id": "3bbc1f6b-4df6-3f11-a387-f1ecbd181bd4",
                                                "text": "The whole fabric dries up, or becomes putrid; and, in both cases, sooner or later, tends to a dissolution."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa6d831c-d682-4d9d-b0ac-e51785879e4f",
                                                "sense_id": "3bbc1f6b-4df6-3f11-a387-f1ecbd181bd4",
                                                "text": "On August 16, 2014, a 24-year-old male programmer posted a more than 9,000-word tirade about the dissolution of his relationship with video game developer Zoë Quinn."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b364a7b9-6633-3f9c-aea5-1cfa0baa6956",
                                        "entry_id": "9e807490-a411-3cff-9d57-66a902aeea78",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dissolving, or going into solution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "629b5711-be7b-361a-bd5d-1c3545b6dfb7",
                                        "entry_id": "9e807490-a411-3cff-9d57-66a902aeea78",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being dissolute."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a208df31-6ed9-48e9-a805-67bf52624d86",
                                                "sense_id": "629b5711-be7b-361a-bd5d-1c3545b6dfb7",
                                                "text": "He led a life of dissolution, drinking and gambling almost daily."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "453066a6-2487-4b4d-879e-7416d28adb81",
                        "source_entry_id": "340bf29b-329f-3946-ae4f-4a0c3fcd8fc5",
                        "target_lang_word": "rescission",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rescission",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90109507-5979-3061-b9ea-1526aba86550",
                                        "entry_id": "14138697-158c-3d60-8a70-f3f17c0b1213",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of rescinding: removing, taking away, or taking back."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "559fbd46-d509-3b9c-8162-fcff3a38e943",
                                        "entry_id": "14138697-158c-3d60-8a70-f3f17c0b1213",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The undoing of a contract; repeal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73f6ee55-916f-4fd2-a343-dd8a470ce0f0",
                                                "sense_id": "559fbd46-d509-3b9c-8162-fcff3a38e943",
                                                "text": "According to him, they said, \"'Resign or we'll fire you.'\" Frein resigned and left the school building. However, that same day, he called his union representative, who advised him to withdraw his resignation, which he did, within 24 hours. The school district, however, refused to accept his recission ^([sic]), insisting that Frein was no longer employed by the school district."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc08c013-87a6-4a10-a076-4ed1cfabd0b7",
                                                "sense_id": "559fbd46-d509-3b9c-8162-fcff3a38e943",
                                                "text": "The House narrowly approved a rescissions package from the White House that aims to cancel billions in unspent funds from the prior fiscal year, much of which would not have been spent otherwise."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4735a5f-108f-4381-abb0-ae2d40e05d9b",
                                                "sense_id": "559fbd46-d509-3b9c-8162-fcff3a38e943",
                                                "text": "But the rescission of the spending-freeze memo, which followed a White House effort to respond to confusion about the initial memo, raises questions about how much [President Trump and his team] learned from the experience of 2017."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "929012e9-06f9-4039-aaf1-020f150067d0",
                        "source_entry_id": "340bf29b-329f-3946-ae4f-4a0c3fcd8fc5",
                        "target_lang_word": "résiliation",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "résiliation",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c70acc5e-a614-3bcf-a4ff-28cf8089bab7",
                                        "entry_id": "204dbeb3-f234-3da5-ab1f-e37299c137f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anéantissement pour l’avenir des effets du contrat à exécution successive en raison d’inexécution ou de mauvaise exécution, soit par le consentement des parties, soit par l’autorité des juges."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9015c32d-87e9-4d36-a12f-0b60ec68f6c3",
                                                "sense_id": "c70acc5e-a614-3bcf-a4ff-28cf8089bab7",
                                                "text": "La résiliation d’un bail, d’un contrat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "768fb757-18dd-49b5-8c60-669c5cdb4bb9",
                                                "sense_id": "c70acc5e-a614-3bcf-a4ff-28cf8089bab7",
                                                "text": "Résiliation de vente."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f808a9f-06cc-4fd8-9b4d-773acc1968a0",
                                                "sense_id": "c70acc5e-a614-3bcf-a4ff-28cf8089bab7",
                                                "text": "La résiliation du contrat intervient de plein droit lorsqu’à l'expiration du délai d'exploitation éventuellement prorogé, l'ONF constate que l'exécution de la coupe n'est pas commencée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cbef3fb7-85de-48b8-892b-1f92599befab",
                        "source_entry_id": "340bf29b-329f-3946-ae4f-4a0c3fcd8fc5",
                        "target_lang_word": "rupture",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rupture",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "202f7bbd-d81c-342e-9795-7816b786fcc8",
                                        "entry_id": "76826577-0e63-32d3-a76a-907add10556c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action par laquelle une chose est rompue ; état d’une chose rompue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9c25883-ac02-4b0c-aa59-fd64f42a4aa4",
                                                "sense_id": "202f7bbd-d81c-342e-9795-7816b786fcc8",
                                                "text": "Cette banquise, qui couvrait plusieurs milliers de lieues carrées, stationna pendant quatre cents ans à la même place, suivant la tradition, et se rompit tout à coup en 1817; ce fut cette rupture qui détermina la fameuse expédition du capitaine Ross pour la découverte du passage du Nord-Ouest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df602367-68cd-4c1e-a353-21d806c1cce7",
                                                "sense_id": "202f7bbd-d81c-342e-9795-7816b786fcc8",
                                                "text": "Sa résistance à la rupture est égale à celle de la laine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85b0d1cb-4127-4100-81be-adcd6f09d2c2",
                                                "sense_id": "202f7bbd-d81c-342e-9795-7816b786fcc8",
                                                "text": "Deux risques majeurs sont visés par cette disposition : le risque de rupture de flexibles hydrauliques passant à proximité du poste de travail et le risque de rupture des éléments tournant à grande vitesse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b1160b10-f6bf-364b-93a7-cf2fe7826576",
                                        "entry_id": "76826577-0e63-32d3-a76a-907add10556c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Déchirement survenant dans un organe ou dans une membrane."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f643278-42ef-4b6c-ae55-825bcd88347a",
                                                "sense_id": "b1160b10-f6bf-364b-93a7-cf2fe7826576",
                                                "text": "Une rupture d’anévrisme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "952acf6e-9755-4dc3-b13c-597740840de0",
                                                "sense_id": "b1160b10-f6bf-364b-93a7-cf2fe7826576",
                                                "text": "Ecchymoses des muscles antérolatéraux et de leurs gaines aponévrotiques, ruptures du chef antérieur du sterno-cléido-mastoïdien, manchon ecchymotique péricarotidien, spume, exophtalmie et lividités : il ne fait aucun doute que la victime est morte par pendaison !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f04af74-ec93-338b-9b54-9a452787ae80",
                                        "entry_id": "76826577-0e63-32d3-a76a-907add10556c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Division qui se produit entre des personnes qui étaient unies par traité, par amitié, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8903e95e-df69-4e78-a622-cd4a16516fdc",
                                                "sense_id": "3f04af74-ec93-338b-9b54-9a452787ae80",
                                                "text": "Lequel des deux est l’auteur de la rupture ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "242449d9-6fb2-4859-8cc3-fd037f3877fe",
                                                "sense_id": "3f04af74-ec93-338b-9b54-9a452787ae80",
                                                "text": "Ils en sont venus à une rupture."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5fec56fa-976d-4010-bf44-510d1956f334",
                                                "sense_id": "3f04af74-ec93-338b-9b54-9a452787ae80",
                                                "text": "Il y a rupture entre ces deux puissances."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1df2f850-0f2f-4f8e-9053-c5448f583559",
                                                "sense_id": "3f04af74-ec93-338b-9b54-9a452787ae80",
                                                "text": "Cette rupture n’est qu’apparente, que passagère."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3bd00e6-da08-39d0-8283-6a4449661586",
                                        "entry_id": "76826577-0e63-32d3-a76a-907add10556c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Séparation de deux personnes qui étaient liées par une liaison amoureuse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad83f78a-ae2e-452f-b766-a1f6a7f6f14a",
                                                "sense_id": "c3bd00e6-da08-39d0-8283-6a4449661586",
                                                "text": "Je connaissais bien cette irréparable tristesse qui suit les ruptures."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58446f74-5620-3a6c-bf1d-d6f1581ed23e",
                                        "entry_id": "76826577-0e63-32d3-a76a-907add10556c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Annulation des traités et des actes publics ou particuliers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0acdcf0-3457-4b94-8ddb-6c5f878dfff1",
                                                "sense_id": "58446f74-5620-3a6c-bf1d-d6f1581ed23e",
                                                "text": "Depuis la rupture de la paix."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "930dbe73-1d00-473c-aca3-79c86711e1dc",
                                                "sense_id": "58446f74-5620-3a6c-bf1d-d6f1581ed23e",
                                                "text": "Depuis la rupture de leur société."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
